TEMPLATE D — CHEST OF DRAWERS (THREE SEPARATE CONSTRUCTION-FAMILY PRODUCTS)
=========================================================================
A chest of drawers is built as up to THREE separate products (same as the trunk
model), one per construction family. Each is a grid-engine product with a stack
of free pickers. Legs + Handles are ALWAYS-ON free pickers (no price change).
Size (drawer count) may be single OR multi; price is per-size variant.

  FAMILY 1 — SOLID WOOD: Construction=[Wood] (fixed label). Pickers:
      Wood Finish (source wood_finishes) + Legs + Handles. NO leather, NO kilim,
      NO metal-finish-of-hardware. aav.swatches = [2 Legs, 3 Handle].
      aav.wood_finishes = full 8-finish set.
  FAMILY 2 — KILIM: Construction=[Kilim] (fixed label + material_notes trust note).
      Pickers: Leather Trim (branch, Leather category, include_names Ebony+Chestnut)
      + Metal Finish + Legs + Handles.
      aav.swatches = [Ebony, Chestnut, 3 hardware, 2 Legs, 3 Handle].
  FAMILY 3 — FULL LEATHER: Construction=[Leather] (fixed label). Pickers:
      Leather Colour (branch, category 'Furniture Leather') + Metal Finish +
      Legs + Handles.
      aav.swatches = [10 Furniture Leather, 3 hardware, 2 Legs, 3 Handle].

